```

## Delete — soft (default)

```typescript
await db.collection(COLLECTION).updateOne(
  { _id: id, group_id: user.group_id }, // Dedicated: { _id: id } only
  { $set: { status: 'deleted', updated_at: new Date().toISOString() } }
)
```

## Client fetch

```typescript
const res = await fetch(addTokenToUrl('/api/items/list?limit=20&offset=0'))
const result = await res.json()
if (!result.success) { /* handle result.code */ }
```

External platform APIs (`via.posif.com`) may use `Authorization: Bearer` — exception to app JWT query rule.
